Package: oocolor
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: COLOR CONVERTER
 Converts between HEX, RGB, HSL, CMYK, and ANSI 256 color representations.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
